# Vic Fontaine, One Night Only: "Seek out — Whenever you draw your second card each turn, one or two target creatures each get
# +2/+0 and gain lifelink until end of turn." On turn three the draw step is the first card and Ancestral Recall the second, so
# the ability goes on the stack with two targets - Vic itself, its controller's, and Bot2's Ornithopter (CR 603.2a, 121.2a,
# 601.2c) - never three, and never none. A noncreature artifact is not an acceptable target, the pump is +2/+0 so toughness does not move, and both the pump
# and the lifelink are gone on the next turn (CR 611.2a, 514.2).

